    </region>
    <region left="333" top="855" width="439" height="20" color="#000000" fontSize="10"><text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10"><content><p style="font-size: 8px;">//Highest possible LED update rate (data transmission only)</p></content></text></region><region left="0" top="900" width="287" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="text-decoration: underline;">1.6 Concept 1 - Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350)</p>
