        <content>
          <p><span style="font-weight: bold;">Conclusion:</span> Using the measured battery current gives a more realistic operating time of about 66 minutes, compared with 26.5 minutes at the theoretical maximum load and 42.6 minutes at the 58% brightness limit. The measured converter efficiency is about 81%, slightly below the assumed 90%.</p></content>
