        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 8px;">// Bostik Super Epoxy TDS (2025) gives a bulk tensile strength of 50 MPa. A conservative allowable bond stress of 2 MPa is used because adhesion to PETG and polycarbonate governs the joint strength.</p>
        </content>
