    <region left="0" top="11736" width="772" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="8">
      <text lang="eng" width="760" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 8px;">//The PETG blade mount sits on the top of the hilt and is bonded with epoxy on the lip (flange) at its base. The bond is modelled as an annulus between the Ø25 mm mount bore and the Ø53 mm top of the hilt, carrying the clash moment and shear at the mount.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
